302
00:13:33,610 --> 00:13:36,150
Sex and the city. Yikes.

303
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:38,530
Hey, I happen to love this mie.

304
00:13:38,620 --> 00:13:40,200
Fine, let's watch it.

305
