It means "doo-doo."

396
00:18:17,990 --> 00:18:19,240
All right!

397
00:18:19,330 --> 00:18:20,630
First of all, Dr. Koothrappali,

398
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:22,830
When I first proposed that you work with me..

399
