If I'm wrong, prove it.

403
00:18:33,890 --> 00:18:35,340
Okay.

404
00:18:35,390 --> 00:18:37,880
Here's where we derive the mass of the Dark Matter particle.

405
00:18:37,930 --> 00:18:39,060
No, no, no.

406
00:18:39,150 --> 00:18:40,710
You've misstated the atomic weight of the target.

407
00:18:40,770 --> 00:18:42,400
- Let me finish. - You're defacing my work.

408
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:44,350
I'm not defacing it, I'm fixing it.

409
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:46,100
- Give me the eraser. - No.

410
00:18:46,190 --> 00:18:47,520
I said give it to me.

411
00:18:47,590 --> 00:18:49,720
Come and get it.

412
00:18:50,730 --> 00:18:53,360
Fine.

413
00:18:54,610 --> 00:18:56,610
Oh, lord.

414
00:18:57,670 --> 00:19:00,330
Dr. Koothrappali,

415
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:02,920
As your superior, I forbid you from writing on my board!

416
00:19:03,010 --> 00:19:04,420
You are not my superior.

417
00:19:04,510 --> 00:19:05,760
I am in every way.

418
00:19:05,840 --> 00:19:06,790
Oh, yeah?

419
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:09,130
Can you do this?

420
00:19:11,550 --> 00:19:14,130
Nice working with you.

421
00:19:17,470 --> 00:19:20,220
I'm sorry-- for you.

422
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:42,850
Raj...

423
00:19:42,930 --> 00:19:45,680
Raj... Raj...

424
00:19:46,690 --> 00:19:48,450
