430
00:19:58,910 --> 00:20:00,620
- So you were wrong. - I didn't say that.

431
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:01,870
That's the only logical inference.

432
00:20:01,950 --> 00:20:03,770
Nevertheless, I didn't say it.

433
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:07,770
Anyway, I would like you to come back and work for me.

434
00:20:07,840 --> 00:20:09,890
For you or with you?

435
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:14,230
In this coext "for me" could mean "with me."

436
00:20:14,300 --> 00:20:15,530
All right, but I have some conditions.

437
00:20:15,580 --> 00:20:18,220
- I reject them all. - I'll take the job.

438
00:20:18,800 --> 00:20:20,130
